        "text_W4YYQp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p><strong>Join Kryon, Lee Carroll, Monika Muranyi, Marilyn Harper and Elan Cohen for an intimate gathering over two days in Sanford, Florida!</strong></p><p>Lee and Monika will be sharing the latest teachings from Kryon, that revolve around the magnificence of the Human Being and the grand evolution that Human consciousness is going through. Have you ever wondered:</p><ul><li><strong>Does the Earth have unseen energies?</strong></li><li><strong>Why is there so much chaos happening?</strong></li><li><strong>Are there any prophecies that tell us about the future?</strong></li><li><strong>Are we doomed by further developing artificial intelligence?</strong></li></ul><p>If you’ve pondered these thoughts, then come join us to discover the answers to these questions and more. In addition, there will be <strong>meditations and channelling, including the CIRCLE OF TWELVE and the very special GREEN MIST</strong>.<br/><br/><strong>They will be joined by Marilyn Harper, the channeller for Adironnda, who will be teaching:</strong><br/><strong>The Miraculous Human Experience: Unlocking Hidden Potentials</strong></p><ul><li>Discover the astonishing potential within us to heal ourselves from within.</li><li>Unveil the scientific secrets behind the power of intention and how it shapes our reality.</li><li>Learn to dismantle and transcend limiting belief systems that hold us back from our true capabilities.</li><li>Delve into the immersive world of visualization and experience its transformative power firsthand.</li><li>Align yourself with holographic energies that harmonize the mind, body, and spirit profoundly.</li><li>Embrace and integrate messages from realms beyond the physical, enhancing your journey with wisdom from other dimensions.</li></ul><p>Don’t miss this rare opportunity to come and connect with like-minded individuals and the Kryon Soul Family.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
